    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, magic is percieved as a body anomaly, and its owners are condemned, censored and criticised. It's hard for them to find work, housing, and acceptance in society. And Evelyn Vozui is not an exception. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evelyn is keeping a quiet living, struggling after moving to a new city. Her life is thrown upside down after being invited to join a troupe, housing magic owners only. As the story unfolds, you are absorbed in life of the Kriv circus and social and personal life of main character, as well as her troubles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evelyn's fate is in your hands from this point. What priorities will she set? What awaits her in the future? It's up to you to decide! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ATTENTION!!!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This product only has a prologue and first part, other chapters would be available in future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-3 hours of gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0More than 12 unique characters present with more to come in the future </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Branching story and multiple endings (planned) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Voiced in both English and Russian!</p>",
